          "title": "Angular Velocity after Uniform Acceleration",
          "problemStatement": "A flywheel starts from rest and accelerates uniformly at $\\\\alpha = 2.0\\\\text{ rad/s}^2$ for $5.0\\\\text{ s}$. Find its final angular speed $\\\\omega$.",
